{
 "id": 1778772,
 "titulo": "12/20 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1671520574491,
 "modificada": 1733103866871,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1778772",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents!&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The leader of Limbo and the master of metal<br>\nwill show our Agents their new looks!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Through this additional patch,<br>\na new Uniform and Tier-3 Advancement for Magik,<br>\nand a new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement for Magneto will be added.&nbsp;<br>\nMagneto and Magik will show their powerful Mutant powers!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out their new skills and powers<br>\nby downloading the 12/20 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[12/21 (Wed) 3:16&nbsp;(UTC+0), 12/20 (Tue) 19:16&nbsp;(PST) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 12/21 (Wed) 3:14&nbsp;(UTC+0), 12/20 (Tue) 19:14&nbsp;(PST).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 12/20 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><s><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 12/21 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 12/20 (Tue) 19:00 (PST)</span></span></s></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand t</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">he completion time will be announced once the patch has been finished</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves, so the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 12/20 Patch data is applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Magneto &lt;Krakoan Winter&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2022/12/20 Patch - 2023/1/3 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2022/12/20 Patch - 2023/1/3 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Crystal purchase (Discount events will not be applied)</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Magik &lt;Krakoan Winter&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2022/12/20 Patch - 2023/1/6 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0),&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 2022/12/20 Patch - 2023/1/6 (Fri) 6:59 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Shop with Holiday Tokens<br>\n- Holiday Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products and more&nbsp;<br>\nuntil 2023/1/3 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), 2023/1/3 (Tue) 6:59 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The &lt;Krakoan Winter&gt; Uniforms may be available for purchase again&nbsp;<br>\nafter the event has been over through similar events or packages.&nbsp;<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1468\" id=\"1671433454125\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/dc41d6f1152543bdac8c052943d5864e_1671433454125_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1416\" id=\"1671433454142\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/328f4925c02948589939d45e9e3fbf2f_1671433454142_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Magik Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Magik is now available for Tier-3 Advancement.<br>\nThe powerful flame of Limbo will help you in battles.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"345\" id=\"1671433472164\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a53ee831e8a34bf2add92c074e0a46a9_1671433472164_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1671434146021\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/bc26de3cfb604753abc7d620bfe9e362_1671434146021.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Magneto Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Magneto is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nMagneto, a member of the Quiet Council, will show his powers for the order of the Mutants.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"312\" id=\"1671433488916\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/01c12cb02c524b0ca9caa6e7a427f9d0_1671433488916_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Artifacts for Magneto and Magik have been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" id=\"1671433498177\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c7d53f8d8fac40c59a573331b90fbf3f_1671433498177_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The issue of some texts not being displayed in the effects of Burn has been fixed.<br>\nBefore - Burn: Decreases all Defense by N%<br>\nTo be fixed - Burn: Decreases all Basic Defenses by N%</span></span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1671433173243\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/44373f7408b34a6fac4054aebb268d4e_1671433173243_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}